# Quanta secrets — copy this file to SECRETS next to app.py and fill in values.
# Do NOT commit SECRETS. You may copy SECRETS between trusted machines / standalone installs.
#
# Format: KEY=value  (one per line, no spaces around =). Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# --- GitHub API (optional) ---
# Create a token: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Classic token: enable "public_repo" (enough for public release checks).
# Paste the FULL token after = (keep the ghp_ / github_pat_ prefix — do not delete it).
#
# Example (replace with your real token on one line):
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Aliases: QUANTA_GITHUB_TOKEN=...  or  GH_TOKEN=...
# Environment variables override this file if set.
